    <MissileTemplate>
      <SaveKey>$MODMIS$/SGM-H-301 Atlatl I</SaveKey>
      <Designation>SGM-H-301</Designation>
      <Nickname>Atlatl I</Nickname>
      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_CRUISE - &lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_COMMAND_ABBREV&lt;/color&gt;/$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_ARAD_HOJ_ABBREV(&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;) - $MISSILEWARHEAD_SHORT_HEIMPACT</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-H-301 Atlatl I&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 3 waypoint-capable cruise missile.  It is based on the SGM-H-3 body, which is a high speed hybrid missile designed to strike heavy targets.  This missile will deliver a Contact Fuze, High Explosive, Shaped warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Radar Home-on-Jam seeker.

$MISSILESTAT_CONTROLMETHOD: $MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_CRUISE_LONG
$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE: &lt;b&gt;&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_POS&lt;/color&gt;	&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRACK[+$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRP]&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/b&gt;

