    <MissileTemplate>
      <SaveKey>$MODMIS$/SGM-H-303 Atlatl III</SaveKey>
      <Designation>SGM-H-303</Designation>
      <Nickname>Atlatl III</Nickname>
      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_CRUISE - &lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_COMMAND_ABBREV&lt;/color&gt;/$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_SEMIACTIVE_ABBREV(&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;) - $MISSILEWARHEAD_SHORT_HEKP</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-H-303 Atlatl III&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 3 waypoint-capable cruise missile.  It is based on the SGM-H-3 body, which is a high speed hybrid missile designed to strike heavy targets.  This missile will deliver a Delayed Contact Fuze, High Explosive, Kinetic Penetrator warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Semi-Active Radar seeker.

$MISSILESTAT_CONTROLMETHOD: $MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_CRUISE_LONG
$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE: &lt;b&gt;&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_POS&lt;/color&gt;	&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRACK[+$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRP]&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/b&gt;

